G adventure. Along the way you rescue your brothers and meet companions who help with meal recipes, blueprints for forging weapons and armor, and even an armored mole vehicle. Combat is brutal and punishing.\n\nThe charming animal world hides a grim tone, and the narration by Doug Cockle, well known in RPG circles, adds weight. Single-player, Tails of Iron suits players who like challenging action RPGs with a storybook look."}}